# Phase 4 — Image Search

## Task 11 — Select Image Search Provider

Choose an image-search/data provider.

Requirements:

- [x] Image search capability
- [x] Search by product name
- [x] Return image URL
- [x] Return source URL
- [x] Return candidate title/metadata where available
- [x] Reasonable API limits
- [x] Reliable API
- [x] Understand pricing
- [x] Understand rate limits
- [x] Review commercial usage considerations
- [x] Review provider terms
- [x] Review image licensing/usage considerations

### Important

Do **not** build the system around:

```text
Google Images → first result → download
```

The system must treat search results as **candidates**, not automatically correct images.

