# Phase 5 — Image Search Abstraction

## Task 12 — Create `ImageSearchService`

Create interface:

```typescript
interface ImageSearchService {
  search(query: string): Promise<ImageCandidate[]>;
}
```

Define:

```typescript
type ImageCandidate = {
  imageUrl: string;
  sourceUrl: string;
  title?: string;
  width?: number;
  height?: number;
};
```

- [x] Define `ImageCandidate`
- [x] Define `ImageSearchService`
- [x] Implement provider-specific service
- [x] Keep provider implementation separate
- [x] Make provider replaceable

Expected architecture:

```text
ImageSearchService
       │
       ├── Provider A
       │
       ├── Provider B
       │
       └── Future Provider
```

