# MVP Acceptance Criteria

## AC-01 — Image Search

Given a product without an image:

```text
Product
 ↓
Search
 ↓
Candidate Images
```

must work.

- [x] Candidate images returned
- [x] Candidate URLs available
- [x] Source URLs available

---

## AC-02 — Confidence Score

The system must calculate:

```text
0–100
```

for each candidate.

- [x] Score calculated
- [x] Score persisted where appropriate
- [x] Score logged

---

## AC-03 — High Confidence Upload

Given:

```text
confidence >= 90
```

the image can be uploaded to Cloudinary.

- [x] Image validated
- [x] Image uploaded
- [x] Cloudinary public ID returned
- [x] Cloudinary URL returned

---

## AC-04 — Database Persistence

After upload:

```text
product_images
```

must contain:

```text
product_id
cloudinary_public_id
secure_url
source_url
confidence_score
status
```

---

## AC-05 — Correct Product Association

Image must be associated through:

```text
product_images.product_id
        ↓
products.id
```

Never rely on the product name as the database relationship.

---

## AC-06 — Idempotency

Running:

```bash
pnpm enrich:images
```

multiple times must not create duplicate images.

---

## AC-07 — Manual Review

Low-confidence results must be:

```text
REVIEW_REQUIRED
```

and included in:

```text
image-review.csv
```

---

## AC-08 — Failure Tracking

Failed processing must be recorded as:

```text
FAILED
```

with useful error information.

---

## AC-09 — Retry

Transient failures must be retryable.

---

## AC-10 — Storefront

The storefront must be able to retrieve:

```typescript
product.images;
```

and display the primary image.

---

# Definition of Done

The feature is complete when:

```bash
pnpm import:products
```

followed by:

```bash
pnpm enrich:images
```

successfully processes the product catalog.

Expected output:

```text
========================================
PRODUCT IMAGE ENRICHMENT
========================================

Products found:       1,000

Already processed:      120
Processing:             880

Uploaded:               731
Review required:         96
Not found:               31
Failed:                  22

========================================
COMPLETE
========================================
```

PostgreSQL:

```text
products
    │
    ├── product_images
    ├── product_images
    └── product_images
```

Cloudinary:

```text
products/
├── SKU-001/
├── SKU-002/
├── SKU-003/
└── ...
```

Next.js:

```text
Product
   ↓
product.images
   ↓
Primary Image
   ↓
Cloudinary
```

