# Architecture Principle

The most important architectural decision:

```typescript
interface ImageSearchService {
  search(query: string): Promise<ImageCandidate[]>;
}
```

The ecommerce application should depend on the **interface**, not directly on a specific image-search provider.

Therefore:

```text
Application
     ↓
ImageSearchService
     ↓
Provider
```

instead of:

```text
Application
     ↓
Google/Bing/Provider-specific code
```

This allows the image provider to be replaced without rewriting the image enrichment system.

---

