- [ ] Retry
- [ ] Manual review CSV
- [ ] Next.js product image display

### Build later

- [ ] Admin dashboard
- [ ] Image review UI
- [ ] Drag-and-drop image management
- [ ] Multiple image management
- [ ] Product image replacement UI
- [ ] AI image matching
- [ ] Automatic image background removal
- [ ] Advanced image moderation
- [ ] Supplier synchronization
- [ ] Scheduled catalog synchronization

---

# Success Metric

The system should ultimately answer:

> **"Given a product SKU, can we reliably determine its correct image, store that image permanently in Cloudinary, and retrieve it through the product?"**

If the answer is **yes**, the image enrichment system is working.
